Subject: [PATCH 0980/3799] soh: rename func_808896B8 ->
 BgHidanHrock_WaitForHit

Name source: DEDUCED from the code (confidence HIGH) -- zeldaret/oot
leaves this symbol address-named too, so there is no upstream name to adopt.
Reason: runs the AC check until the pillar is struck, then sets the switch flag and starts the shake; meanwhile it bobs 5 units when the player stands on it.
Defined in soh/src/overlays/actors/ovl_Bg_Hidan_Hrock/z_bg_hidan_hrock.c.

Tagged [LLM:HIGH] at the definition, every declaration and every call site, so a
reader meeting the name anywhere knows it is inferred.
---
 soh/soh/Network/Anchor/HookHandlers.cpp                    | 4 ++--
 .../overlays/actors/ovl_Bg_Hidan_Hrock/z_bg_hidan_hrock.c  | 7 ++++---
 2 files changed, 6 insertions(+), 5 deletions(-)

diff --git a/soh/soh/Network/Anchor/HookHandlers.cpp b/soh/soh/Network/Anchor/HookHandlers.cpp
index 103016a41..915abe953 100644
--- a/soh/soh/Network/Anchor/HookHandlers.cpp
+++ b/soh/soh/Network/Anchor/HookHandlers.cpp
@@ -36,7 +36,7 @@ void func_8086ED70(BgBombwall* bgBombwall, PlayState* play);
